00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:29.420
memblokirnya,

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:30.380
mereka akan menempelkan

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:30.900
data ke Teams.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:32.080
Kesalahan Anda.

00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:33.220
Kesalahan umum.

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:34.440
Membatasi DLP

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:35.560
hanya ke action dan Teams

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:36.520
karena kebijakan sharepoint

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:36.900
berisik.

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:37.880
Itu berisik

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:38.780
jika Anda tidak mengaturnya.

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:40.280
Juga mengecualikan sharepoint

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:40.860
demi performa.

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:41.840
Performa apa?

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:43.260
Respons insir Anda berikutnya.

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:44.360
Terakhir,

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:45.040
hanya mengandalkan

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:45.740
jenis BI generik

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:46.740
sambil mengabaikan EDM.

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:48.400
Anda memiliki pengenal yang tepat.

00:19:48.780 --> 00:19:49.000
Gunakan.

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:50.460
Ujian, sungguhnya.

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:51.840
Agen di luar cakuman

00:19:51.840 --> 00:19:52.920
mencoba menjawab pertanyaan

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:53.740
yang memerlukan file

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:54.680
berlabel rahasia.

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:56.100
Hasilnya harus

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:57.020
berupa blokir langsung,

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:57.840
pesan instruktif,

00:19:58.140 --> 00:19:59.160
dan peringatan tingkat tinggi

00:19:59.160 --> 00:19:59.780
di alur Anda.

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:01.300
Jika Anda malah

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:02.040
mendapatkan jawaban

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:02.680
yang meyakinkan

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:03.640
DLP Anda hiasan.

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:04.540
Buat berfungsi

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:05.080
bukan sekedar saja.
